| `make verify` `[local]` | Runs a local install preflight, then every gate: checks, the secret scan of the history, lint, types, tests, requirement traceability, replayed evals, frontend tests and shell tests, through `scripts/gate_evidence.py`, and writes their evidence record. Every goal judges by the date the run began. "Done" means this exits 0. | `make verify` | [`PY`](settings.md#make-variables), [`evidence.dir`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evidence.run_date.env`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evidence.run_date.max_age_days`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | With a frontend app, its frontend suites exit 2 until `make fe-install` has run, and its journey fails until `make fe-browsers` has; frontend lint and type-check exit 0 when `npm` or `node_modules` is missing. A project with no frontend app runs no frontend gate. Its `secret-scan` goal exits 11 until `make secrets-install` has run, and 13 before the first commit. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md) | always |
